  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN284.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">1. viṉaimuṟṟiya talaimakaṉ ṟērppākaṟkuc colliyatu.  2. taṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatūumām.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">1. What HE who had finished work said to the charioteer. 2. It is also what was said to his own heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN284.1">
        <l>ciṟiyilai nellik kāykaṇ ṭaṉṉa</l>
        <l>kuṟuvi<supplied>ḻi</supplied>k kaṇṇa kūralaṅ kuṟumuyal</l>
        <l>muṭantai varakiṉ vīṅku<supplied>pī</supplied> ḷaruntu</l>
        <l>kuṭantaiyañ ceviya kōṭ<supplied>pa</supplied>va roṭuṅki</l>
        <l>yiṉṟuyi leḻuntu tuṇaiyoṭu pōki</l>
        <l>muṉṟiṟ ciṟuniṟai nīrkaṇ ṭuṇṇum</l>
        <l>puṉpulan taḻīiya poṟaimutaṟ ciṟukuṭit</l>
        <l>tiṉaikka ḷuṇṭa terikoṇ maṟavar</l>
        <l>vicaitta villar vēṭṭam pōki</l>
        <l>mullaip paṭappai pulvāy keṇṭuṅ</l>
        <l>kāmar puṟavi ṉatuvē kā<supplied>ma</supplied></l>
        <l>nammiṉun tāṉṟalai mayaṅkiya</l>
        <l>vammā varivai yuṟaivi ṉūrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="11a-c">It [is] in the adorable woodland,</l>
        <l corresp="8">where the perceptive bold men, who had consumed millet [and] toddy,</l>
        <l corresp="9">go for hunt, their bows fast,</l>
        <l corresp="10">[and] cut into the deer in the jasmine gardens,</l>
        <l corresp="7">in the small hamlet on the hillock encircled by poor  fields</l>
        <l corresp="2">where the fluffy little hare, its eyes with small eyeballs</l>
        <l corresp="1">that look like the unripe fruit of the small-leaved gooseberry trees,</l>
        <l corresp="3">after having eaten of the tender ear swelling on the crippled millet,</l>
        <l corresp="4">shrinks into the ear[-like] creepers of Kuṭantai,</l>
        <l corresp="5">rises from sweet sleep, goes with [its] mate,</l>
        <l corresp="6">sees water in little quantity(?)  in the front yard [and] drinks [it],</l>
        <l corresp="13">− the village pleasing to stay of that dark young woman,</l>
        <l corresp="11d-12">who is perturbed even more than us by passion.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
